## {{ CLI_NAME }} ({{ SINGULAR_NAME }} engine)

This project uses the `{{ CLI_NAME }}` CLI to keep AI-generated content maintainable.

{{ CAPITALIZED_CLI_NAME }} live inside packages at `{{ MAIN_FOLDER }}/{{ INTERNAL_FOLDER }}/<package>/{{ SRC_FOLDER }}/{{ ACTIVE_FOLDER }}/{{ MULTI_USE_FOLDER }}/<name>/` (multi-use) or
